    24                                  ; Good_Test V6 warrior 2 (friend-provided; reconstructed source in
    25                                  ; study-notes/good-test-v6/source/). agent2 label form: hard-coded internal
    26                                  ; offsets replaced by label arithmetic with the original operand widths.
    27                                  ; agent2 night A026 variant Z1 (base rev0 = V6nohunt B): captured zombies spend
    28                                  ; their own INT 86h charge (2 per zombie, unused before) on FF 1F CC CC decoy
    29                                  ; blocks for the FF1FCCCC INT87 searchers.
    30                                  ;  - zom20a path (CX!=0): after its b/d INT87, mov ax,1FFFh; int 86h with
    31                                  ;    DI=0, DF=1, DX=CCCCh -> block 0FF04h..0003h (no code is ever loaded below
    32                                  ;    400h or above FC00h; page FFh and 00h:00-03 hold no anchor of our 400h
    33                                  ;    lattice at 52h).
    34                                  ;  - b/d path (CX=0): the worthless 0E070E17 CC counter-bomb INT87 is replaced
    35                                  ;    by a block next to the zombie's own body (BX = own load address + 3):
    36                                  ;    [X+68h, X+168h), X = (BX and FC00h). Inside the zombie's MIN_GAP zone
    37                                  ;    and on pages 4k / 4k+1 outside in-page 52h-67h of pages 4k, so it can
    38                                  ;    hit neither loaded code nor any anchor/worker of our lattice.
    39                                  ;  - zombie band math uses 16-bit DIV (same AX, 2 instructions fewer), so both
    40                                  ;    zombie paths reach phoenix_init on the same turn as in rev0.
    41                                  ; B's own startup is unchanged.
    42                                  
    43                                  ; A031 K = A026 Z1 (zombie INT86 blocks) + A022 SD (phoenix_init mov cx,10; dead mov dx,[4A17h] dropped; db 0CCh,0CCh after the worker). B startup unchanged.
